  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing and combating information disorders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO will support the Ministry of Information through its campaign to combat disimformation through, a) Enhancing the capacities of National News Agency (NNA) field reporters in relation to fact-checking plus video reporting, and privide them with 10 cameras in an effort to improve their abilities to cover crisis, and b) Support the development and implementation of a media awareness campaign on TVs, social media, radios to combat disinformation, hate speech and encourage fact-checking. This campaign will be delivered through social media messages and will build on previous success stories such as #PostWithCare campaign that was recently developed by UNESCO and will be adapted to the Lebanese context.</narrative>
  </description>
